@startuml
!define PRIMARY_COLOR #2E86AB
!define SECONDARY_COLOR #A23B72
!define SUCCESS_COLOR #18A999
!define WARNING_COLOR #F18F01
!define DANGER_COLOR #C73E1D

' Style
skinparam class {
  BackgroundColor White
  BorderColor PRIMARY_COLOR
  ArrowColor PRIMARY_COLOR
}
skinparam stereotypeFontColor SECONDARY_COLOR
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0

title Diagramme de classes — Modèle principal

legend left
Ce diagramme agrège les entités majeures (Eloquent) et leurs relations.
Les méthodes indiquent les opérations métier usuelles des contrôleurs Laravel.
Fin de légende
end legend

class User <<Entity>> {
  +id: bigint
  +name: string
  +email: string
  +role: enum {passager, chauffeur}
  +phone_number: string
  +created_at: datetime
  +updated_at: datetime
  --
  +register(data)
  +login(credentials)
  +updateProfile(data)
}

class DriverProfile <<Entity>> {
  +id: bigint
  +user_id: bigint
  +license_number: string
  +rating: decimal
  +status: enum {active, suspended}
  +created_at: datetime
  +updated_at: datetime
  --
  +acceptCourse(courseId)
  +updateAvailability(flag)
}

class Vehicle <<Entity>> {
  +id: bigint
  +driver_profile_id: bigint
  +make: string
  +model: string
  +plate_number: string
  +color: string
  +created_at: datetime
  +updated_at: datetime
}

class Course <<Entity>> {
  +id: bigint
  +passenger_id: bigint
  +driver_profile_id: bigint [0..1]
  +origin_lat: decimal
  +origin_lng: decimal
  +dest_lat: decimal
  +dest_lng: decimal
  +estimated_price: decimal
  +status: enum {pending, accepted, in_progress, done, canceled}
  +created_at: datetime
  +updated_at: datetime
  --
  +estimatePrice()
  +dispatch()
  +start()
  +complete()
  +cancel()
}

class Position <<Entity>> {
  +id: bigint
  +driver_profile_id: bigint
  +course_id: bigint [0..1]
  +lat: decimal
  +lng: decimal
  +timestamp: datetime
  +created_at: datetime
  +updated_at: datetime
}

class Notification <<Entity>> {
  +id: bigint
  +user_id: bigint
  +type: enum {system, booking, security}
  +priority: enum {low, normal, high, urgent}
  +message: text
  +sent_at: datetime
  +read_at: datetime [0..1]
  +metadata: json
  --
  +markAsRead()
  +deleteRead()
}

' Associations
User "1" -- "0..1" DriverProfile : possède >
DriverProfile "1" -- "1" Vehicle : utilise >
User "1" -- "0..*" Course : crée >
DriverProfile "1" -- "0..*" Course : prend en charge >
Course "1" -- "0..*" Position : génère >
User "1" -- "0..*" Notification : reçoit >

note right of Course
Cycle de vie:
pending -> accepted -> in_progress -> done
Transitions pilotées par CourseController
end note

note bottom of Notification
Priorités influent la durée d’affichage (client) et le canal.
end note

@enduml
